{"client_side":"required","server_side":"unsupported","game_versions":["1.20.1"],"environment":[],"id":"ruqoGu2n","slug":"warrior_helmet","project_type":"resourcepack","team":"vfm72hNw","organization":null,"title":"Japanese samurai hat","description":"this is just adding a warrior helmet in the pumpkin style that has been renamed.","body":"---\n\n### 🪖 Samurai Helmets Pack\n\nThis is my **first resource pack**, which adds a collection of custom **samurai-style warrior helmets** inspired by pumpkins.\nIt works best when used **together with OptiFine** (for CIT support).\n\n---\n\n### ⚔️ Features\n\n* Added **8 Samurai Helmets** — craft them by **renaming a Pumpkin** to:\n\n  ```\n  Samurai 1\n  Samurai 2\n  Samurai 3\n  ...\n  Samurai 8\n  ```\n* Each helmet has a unique samurai-inspired design.\n* Includes a **prototype Viking helmet**, which will be expanded in future updates.\n\n---\n\n### 🛠️ Future Plans\n\nI plan to add:\n\n* More **helmet variations**\n* Additional **custom gear and decorative items**\n\n---\n\n### 💬 Feedback\n\nYour feedback means a lot!\nYou can check out my post and share your thoughts here:\n🔗 [https://x.com/Black_Bunny_303/status/1787531388344033605](https://x.com/Black_Bunny_303/status/1787531388344033605)\n\n---","body_url":null,"published":"2024-05-01T18:19:58.804547Z","updated":"2024-05-06T01:52:32.062817Z","approved":"2024-05-06T01:52:46.987679Z","queued":"2024-05-02T05:30:58.182457Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"Apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","url":null},"downloads":2333,"followers":23,"categories":["32x","equipment","themed"],"additional_categories":["models"],"loaders":["minecraft"],"versions":["IDdcXKRL"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ruqoGu2n/0f5417c237586a10284ab785e5d491e47c5af7ff.png","raw_icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ruqoGu2n/0f5417c237586a10284ab785e5d491e47c5af7ff.png","issues_url":null,"source_url":null,"wiki_url":null,"discord_